C:\Obsidian\Hermes\scripture\raw_data\biblehub_study_joshua_19.txt:1031: Hukkok provided another fixed marker in the carefully defined inheritance given to Naphtali. Israel’s tribal boundaries reflected God’s faithful fulfillment of His promise to give the land to the descendants of Abraham.
C:\Obsidian\Hermes\scripture\raw_data\biblehub_study_joshua_19.txt:1035: Jos 18:12 On the north side their border began at the Jordan,…
