C:\Obsidian\Hermes\scripture\raw_data\biblehub_study_joshua_19.txt:1040: Zebulun formed Naphtali’s southern neighbor. The lands of Zebulun and Naphtali later became closely associated with the ministry of Jesus in Galilee, fulfilling Isaiah’s promise that light would dawn in this region (Isaiah 9:1–2; Matthew 4:13–16).
C:\Obsidian\Hermes\scripture\raw_data\biblehub_study_joshua_19.txt:1046: Deu 33:18-19 Concerning Zebulun he said: “Rejoice, Zebulun,…
