C:\Obsidian\Hermes\scripture\raw_data\biblehub_study_joshua_19.txt:1049: Asher bordered Naphtali toward the Mediterranean coastal region. The adjoining territories enabled the tribes to share the resources and responsibilities of life in the Promised Land.
