C:\Obsidian\Hermes\scripture\raw_data\biblehub_study_joshua_19.txt:1087: Zer was another fortified place in Naphtali’s territory. Even cities otherwise unknown in Scripture belonged to the ordered distribution of the land and contributed to Israel’s security in the north.
